## Your Task

Return the corrected `related_losses` or `related_hazards` list for each
selected record, using canonical IDs only. Remove each repeated
entry, or replace it with one listed replacement ID whose meaning the record
was meant to name. Keep the other IDs once each in their original order. A
list that still repeats an ID, drops or reorders a kept ID, or names an ID
outside the kept and replacement IDs is rejected, and there is no second
repair.
